<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">Heber ci</para>
  <para style="toc3">Heb</para>
  <para style="toc2">Heber ci</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fiisi kaɓɗohu Heber ci</para>
  <para style="mt">Fiisi kaɓɗohu Heber ci</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Ali ɓo' inahɗi yi fiis kaɓɗohii, wala ɓooɓi fiisɗuu wa. Wa cambohɗi findi fiisi na kaɓɗohse na cambohe, waaye wa reehoh ɗaa, na kañɗoh.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wa miniɗ nik ne cambohaani saɓsukoh saɓsukoh naa, wi wa na fiisissasse.</para>
  <para style="ip">Fu jang kaɓɗohii ɗah, fu na hote ne wa fiisu wuu ɓi ɓo' ɓi inah baahiɗ Fiis ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ambtiɗohi Koc na wi Asi">Ambtiɗohi Koc</char>. Wa miniɗ nik ne e Yawuut ci fiisuu wa (weɗ tah wa teekuusa Heber ci). Wala wa nam fiisu wuu ɓooɓi kos te ɓa nikɗi Yawuut waaye ɓa jangiɗ Fiis ci maañiɗ ci.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɓa yaaɓeen sagu kosiŋ ɓa, waaye wa reyeeɗi ŋ kakaan.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:4">Heber ci 12:4</ref></char></note> Yi fiisa neƴƴohiɗ ne ɓa faɗ Yeesu, ɓa dokuk ŋ Ambtiɗohi Koc.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ineem weɗ tah kaɓɗohi na teeɓohe ne Ambtiɗohi Asi weɗ uup Ambtiɗohi Koc : Yeesu a yi uup malaakaaci, a yi uup <char style="w">Musaa</char>, a uuppa <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ci yakak ci rimkoh ŋ <char style="w">Aaruna</char>. Kaɓɗohi na teeɓohe ne Fiis ci gapohiɗ ambtiɗoh as. Ca teeɓoh Yeesu findi Seeƴkiɗoh yakak, yi seeƴkoh haf ce waas yino jameet wuu ɓooɓi jen.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fiisi kaɓɗohu Heber ci kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Kooh woyiɗ taamboh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ ɗe</char> <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> a yi uup malaakaaci <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 1:4-2:18">1:4–2:18</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kiristaani a yi uup Musaa na Yosuwe <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 3:1-4:13">3:1–4:13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kiristaani a yi uup yak seeƴkiɗoh ciŋ <char style="w">waasiŋ Musaa</char> <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 4:14-8:6">4:14–8:6</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- E Ambtiɗohi Asi dong min nihis bakaaɗ <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 8:7-10:39">8:7–10:39</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kosaŋ caac ca <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 11">11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Findi ɓo' joy pesoh ŋ Ambtiɗohi Asi <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 12:1-13:19">12:1–13:19</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kiimi na askohi <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:20-25">13:20-25</ref></char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kooh woyiɗ taamboh ŋ Kuɓkiŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1"/>Ŋ maañiɗ, Kooh taambohee ŋ woosuuɗ ci, a woosa na caac ciŋ ɓoo waas laayiɗ te woyohaaɗ ci ɗalohha. <verse eid="HEB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2"/>Waaye ŋ jamanoociŋ reehɗohaaniŋ adinaani ɓoo nikoh cii, a woyiɗ na ɓoo taamboh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ ɗe</char>. Ŋ camba, adinaani na findi wa na tiindohe jen, a feroha Kuɓkeem. Te a yi a eɗan in ci jen. <verse eid="HEB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3"/>A yi siñaariŋ yaki Kooh yak, a yi sah ñaamaariŋ ini Kooh nik keeh-keeh. Te a yi raanuk adinaani jen na woo kiŋ ɗe raakiɗ hatili. Wi a tum po ɓooɓi minnda hoolɗu ŋ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa, weɗ a kaɗoh ŋ Eel ci, a ɓooffa ŋ ñaahmiŋ Kooh yi buur. <verse eid="HEB 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4"/>A uuppa malaakaaci findi tiiki Kooh eɗ ɗe uupoh ciŋ ɓa.<verse eid="HEB 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuɓki a yi uup malaakaaci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5"/>Laam, ɗu inhiɗ ne, woo ki Kooh woo ŋ ɗooƴ Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci wii :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">« Woti, ñam Baabiŋ ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">a fu Kuɓkiŋ ngo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sabuur 2:7</ref></char></note> »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">a moosɗaa woo ali malaaka. Te a namɗi woyoh ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ ali malaaka ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">« Ŋ hey nike Baab nga ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">a nik nga so findi Kuɓu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Samuwel 7:14</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6"/>Te wi a na haytohe Kuɓkiŋ ɗe saawi ŋ Adina, Fiis ci woo ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:6">« Malaakaaciŋ Kooh jen ƴekɗaat ɗe ! »<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Marka teerndiŋ </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Rohƴiɗi 32:43</ref></char> (waaye, fu marak fiis ci ɗeɓgaan ɗah, raakiɗ ɓi fiis ci raakɗi woo keem).</note><verse eid="HEB 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7"/>Inii weɗ Fiis ciŋ Kooh woo ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ malaakaaci :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">« A tum malaakaaci findi puuɗis ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">ɓeɗ pangkoh ciŋ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">a tummba ɓa findi jaal yongkaah.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:4">Sabuur 104:4</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8"/>Waaye ini Kooh woo Kuɓkiŋ ɗe ŋ Fiis ci weɗi wii :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">« Eey Kooh, Nguuriŋ ɗa genan gen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">te salmaariŋ wa, weɗ wiŋ waasi yurhiɗi.<verse eid="HEB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9"/>Fu teeɓohiɗ ne fu waaɗ in yurhiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">fu sang ini nikɗi waas, weɗ tah, eey Kooh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">Koohiŋ ɗa tannda ɗa ŋ ɗooƴ huntoh ciŋ ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">a diwiɗta ɗa hafiŋ ɗa diw eeñiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">wa hunnda na sum.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 45:7-8">Sabuur 45:7-8</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10"/>Kooh namiɗ woo ŋ Fiis ci ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">« Ngaŋ camba, eey Heɗi, a fu yip kehƴi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">te a fu haɓiɗ Eel ci na yaah ciŋ ɗa.<verse eid="HEB 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11"/>In ceem jen hey sooƴe waaye fu, fu genan gen.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:11">Eel ci na kehƴi jen hey kaane findi kulɓa,<verse eid="HEB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12"/>fu lem ca findi palto.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">Wiiriis as degu findi ɓoyi ɓekkis,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">waaye fu, fu risan mand findi fu mand ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">kipes kiŋ ɗa reehanɗi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 102:26-28">Sabuur 102:26-28</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13"/>Markaat rek ! Ini Kooh woo ŋ Fiis ci wii :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">« Haya fu ɓoof ŋ ñaahmiŋ ngo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">po mbaɗna ŋ folan sangiɗ ciŋ ɗa ŋ kehƴi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">fu tum ɓa degoha kot.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sabuur 110:1</ref></char></note> »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:13">A moos woyoh yinde malaaka in mand na weem ?<verse eid="HEB 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14"/>Malaakaaci, ca jen ca pangkoh ci minɗi hotu haa e ? Ca woosu ne ca ɓaatɗoh ɓi rahsan muci haa e ?<verse eid="HEB 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1"/>Ineem weɗ tah ɓoo joyiɗ uup amb ndengiɗ ŋ woo kiŋ Kooh ɓoo kerah, ne ɓoo yoɓuu ŋ kosi ɓoo kos po ɓoo kee faɗsuka. <verse eid="HEB 2:1"/><verse number="2-4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2-4"/>Woo ki Kooh eɗoh ŋ ɗeɓgaana, wa taambohee ŋ malaakaaci, te wa tufkeen. Waaye muci ɓoo raak kotii, weɗ uup yak. Laam, a Heɗi koca gapoh, ɓi keraha ɓaatta ɓoo wa ndengɗiɗ. Kooh teeɓoheeɗa ne woo ciŋ ɓa keeh ngaŋ ɓi firnde, ŋ kehƴi na eel ci, na keemaan nu nik. A nammbaa teeɓoh ŋ in ci <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> na onohe te a paysohee ca ŋ findi a waaɗoha. Ɓoo min na fusoh mbugal, ne ɓoo sagankoh muc hend an yak ɗah, nik ne woo ka ɗeɓgaan sah tufkeen po tumohaaɗ nu huneeɗi naa ɗah mbugaluusa findi wa joy mbugalohu ɗah ?<verse eid="HEB 2:2-4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu, taambɗohi yakkiŋ ɓo' ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5"/>Ŋ waaɗ ɗu woo ne, adinaani na haye, wi ɓoo na woye, Kooh degɗaa ŋ yaah ciŋ malaakaaci. <verse eid="HEB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6"/>Waaye, ŋ Fiis ci, raakiɗ ɓoyi woo Kooh ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">« Ɓo' ye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">po fu liiɓee nga ɗe ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">Wala kuɓu ɓo' ye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">po fu liiɓsiɗohee nga ɗe ?<verse eid="HEB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7"/>Fu degeen ɗe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:7">ŋ ɗiski inah ne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:7">a yi uupee ƴissuut malaakaaci,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:7">waaye wa maañɗi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:7">Fu yakɗiɗ ɗe, a eɗuusa cir,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:7">wa nikka mbahne-buur nga ɗe.<verse eid="HEB 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8"/>Fu degga in ci jen ŋ yaah ciŋ ɗe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:5-7">Sabuur 8:5-7</ref></char></note> »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Kooh woo ne a degiɗ in ci jen ŋ yaah ɓo' ɗah, kon a faɗɗi ali in ; moona woti-woti, ɓoo hotɗi paaɗ ne in ci jen degu ŋ yaah ɓo', <verse eid="HEB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9"/>waaye ɗiski wa nik ndii, e Yeesu, a yi ɓoo na hote. Ɓoo hotiɗ ne Yeesu degseen ɗiski fu inah ne, a yi uupee ƴissuut malaakaaci, waaye wa maañeeɗi ; a degseen nga ne, ngaŋ baahohiŋ Kooh, a kaan wuu ɓooɓi jen. Te ɗiski wa nik, ɓoo na hotee ɗe yakɗuuɗ, eɗuuɗ cir po haa a ɓekɗu mbahne-buur, sagu miskiɗiŋ kakaan ki.<verse eid="HEB 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10"/>A Kooh fer in ci jen te ca jen ca raakiɗ ne ca nik wuu ce. A hotta ne wa baahiɗ ne a lahiɗ Yeesu ŋ miskiɗeem, ne yeem ree ɗiski a joyee ree ngaŋ mit ; ŋ ineem, a nikka yi adgiɗoh ŋ muci ne kuɓu laayiɗ ɓaah ŋ yaki a yak. <verse eid="HEB 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11"/>Laam yi na hoolɗohe na ɓi hoolɗu, ɓa jen ɓeɗ ɓaah Baab. Ineem weɗ tah po a supukɗi ɓa ɓeeɗkoh taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe <verse eid="HEB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12"/>wi a woo Kooh ŋ Fiis ci ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">« Ŋ hey inhiɗe taambɗoh ciŋ ngo tiikiŋ ɗa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">te ŋ hey ɗa ƴeeke ŋ fiki mboolo kosiɗ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:23">Sabuur 22:23</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13"/>A woyissa nga ca ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:13">« Mi, ŋ hey oolke Kooh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:17">Esayi 8:17</ref></char></note> »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">A woyissa nga ca ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:13">« Ñam yii, na kuɓuuci Kooh eɗ to.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:18">Esayi 8:18</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14"/>Kuɓuuci a na woye ɓeem, ɓa ɓo' njaay, heɗ faan na ñif. Ineem weɗ tah po Yeesu ŋ haf ce, nammba ɓaah na ɓa mandohaaɗeem ne, taamboh ŋ kakaan kiŋ ɗe, a saah Seytaani yi ambohee doolndiŋ kakaan. <verse eid="HEB 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15"/>Ŋ ineem, a minnda tokis ɓooɓi jen, ŋ findi ɓa hend, ɓi nikee <char style="w">ñaam</char> ŋ kipes kiŋ ɓa jen sagu neƴƴoh kakaan.<verse eid="HEB 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16"/>Wa wooriɗ ne, Yeesu na taambkohe malaakaaci haa, a na taambkohe ɓi rimkoh ŋ Ibrahiima. <verse eid="HEB 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17"/>Weɗ tah a joyya mand na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ŋ in ci jen ne a nik Seeƴkiɗohiŋ ɓa yakki wuu Kooh, Seeƴkiɗoh riifiɗ na yirmoh, tokɗukiɗ ŋ pangkiɗ Kooh, ne a rahas ɗaasuukiŋ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓooɓi. <verse eid="HEB 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18"/>Ini a lah ŋ miskiɗ sagu fiir ci kipes na jaɗɗohe, weɗ tah po a miniɗ hirip ɓi kipes na jaɗɗe fiir.<verse eid="HEB 2:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu a yi uup yak Musaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1"/>Weɗ tah ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ɗu hoolɗuuɗ wuu Kooh te ɓoo ɓaah ŋ ɓeeɗkohiŋ Eel ci. Kon, markaat ŋ Yeesu, yi nik Woosuuɗi, a nikka Seeƴkiɗohi yakki ŋ waasi ɓoo na woye ne weɗ ɓoo kos. <verse eid="HEB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2"/>A tokɗukeen baahiɗ ŋ pangki Kooh degee ŋ yaah ciŋ ɗe, findi <char style="w">Musaa</char> namee « tokɗukoh ŋ ɗooƴ kahan Kooh [jen]<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:7">Kind ci 12:7</ref></char></note> », findi Fiis ci woyoha. <verse eid="HEB 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3"/>Yi taɓah kahni a yi uup kahni. Weɗ tah, Yeesu eɗaah cir na kiyak ki uup wiŋ Musaa. <verse eid="HEB 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4"/>Kahan nu taɓahu ɗah, a ɓo' taɓaha waaye a Kooh taɓah in ci jen.<verse eid="HEB 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5"/>Mbaa, Musaa « tokɗukeen ŋ ɗooƴ kahan Kooh jen.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:7">Kind ci 12:7</ref></char></note> » Ŋ woo kiŋ Fiis ci weem, a tokɗukee findi yi na pangkiɗe Yi raak kahni, ne a seede ini Kooh hee woye. <verse eid="HEB 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6"/><char style="w">Kiristaa</char> nak, a tokɗukiɗ findi kuɓu ne a adgoh kahan Kooh, te e ɓoo kahneem nik ne ɓoo gen ooluk, wa hun na kaañ, te ɓoo ndamkohe yaakaari ɓoo yaakaar ɗah.<verse eid="HEB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iɗsiɗki Kooh gapoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7"/>Weɗi tah, findi <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> woyoha, ngaŋ Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci, an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:7">« Woti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:7">ɗu kerah hoosooriŋ Kooh ɗah,<verse eid="HEB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8"/>kinaat ndeng haf</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">findi caacuucaŋ ɗu tumohee wa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">ŋ kehƴa hulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">mbaɗna ɓa markiskee ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">ɓa ndengsiɗkoheeɗa na ɗe.<verse eid="HEB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9"/>An mbaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:9">caacuuciŋ ɗu markiskee so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:9">te raak ɓa hotee ngaŋ tumohaaɗ ciŋ ngo<verse eid="HEB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10"/>ini ree kiis ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40).</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">Weɗ tah ŋ raakka neɓsaaɗi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">ŋ ɓooɓaŋ jamanoonaam ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">ŋ woosa ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">“ Liiɓohaaɗ ciŋ ɓa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">na genee ɓa muuƴiɗ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">te ɓa sangiɗ ne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">ɓa inhanɗi ini maa seke ne ɓa tuma. ”<verse eid="HEB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11"/>Sagu ayruki ŋ ayruke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:11">ŋ ginnja ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:11">“ Ɓa rahsanɗi muk iɗsiɗki ŋ gap ɓa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:23">Kind ci 14:23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Sabuur 95:7-11</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 17:7">Pula 17:7</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="HEB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12"/>Kon ɓaah ciŋ ngo wortukaat po ali ɓo' nga ɗu raakuu keeñ baahaaɗi, wi na koseeɗi po wa kee ɗe ɓeka ŋ eɗ finho Koohi na pese.<verse eid="HEB 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13"/>Waaye feeh "woti", wi Fiis ci na woye, wa ɗii nga ɗah, genaat ñaahtiɗoh Kooh-nu-wiis, ne bakaaɗ ñaañohuu ali ɓo' nga ɗu po wa kee ɗe ɓeka keeñ ndengiɗ. <verse eid="HEB 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14"/>Laam, ɓoo ɓaahiɗ na <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> pangki, nik ne ɓoo risiɗ amb ndengiɗ po ŋ reehtinohaana, oolki ɓoo oolkee ngaŋ camba ɗah. <verse eid="HEB 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15"/>Fiis ci woyiɗ ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">« Woti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">ɗu kerah hoosooriŋ Kooh ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">kinaat ndeng haf</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">findi caacuucaŋ ɗu tumohee wa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">mbaɗna ɓa ndengsiɗkohee na ɗe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Sabuur 95:7-8</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16"/>Mbaa e ɓinde kerhee hoosooriŋ Kooh, ɓa ndengsiɗkoheeɗa na ɗe ? Wa hooliɗ ne e ɓooɓa Musaa pulɗohee <char style="w">Misra</char> jen. <verse eid="HEB 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17"/>Kooh namee raak neɓsaaɗi ŋ ɓinde ini ree kiis ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40) ? Wa hooliɗ ne e ɓooɓa bakaaɗee te fiɗaaf caŋ ɓa keennda ŋ kehƴa hulanga. <verse eid="HEB 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18"/>Te Kooh giñee ne e ɓinde heyɗi rahse iɗsiɗka a gapee ɓa ? Wa hooliɗ ne e ɓooɓa kerhiɗeeɗi ɗe. <verse eid="HEB 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19"/>Mbaa ɓoo hotiɗ ne ɓa mineeɗi aas sagu kosaaɗi.<verse eid="HEB 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1"/>Mbaa, Kooh gapiɗ ɓoo ne ɓoo miniɗ rahas iɗsiɗki a woye. Te gapohiŋ ɗe weem, wa ris po wi. Kon ɓoo wortukaat po ali ɓo' nga ɗu kinaat ambu findi ɓo' tasiɗ finho. <verse eid="HEB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2"/>Laam ɓoo namiɗ yegɗu yegɗoh muc findi ɓa fiɗaaf caŋ ɓa keenee ŋ kehƴa hulanga. Woo ka ɓa yegɗasse, wa njirñeeɗi ɓa in sagu ina ɓa ɓaaheeɗi kos na ɓa teyɗukee wa.<verse eid="HEB 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3"/>Waaye ɓoo ɓi kos, ɓoo hey rahse iɗsiɗki Kooh na woye wi a woo ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">« Sagu ayruki ŋ ayruke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">ŋ ginnja ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">“ Ɓa rahsanɗi muk</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">iɗsiɗki ŋ gap ɓa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Sabuur 95:11</ref></char></note> ” »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Moona Kooh ƴutiɗ ŋ pangkiŋ ɗe wa a fer Adina poyi. <verse eid="HEB 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4"/>Raakiɗ ɓaki woo ŋ Fiis ci, ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ mbeha yasna-kanakɗoh, ne : « Kooh iɗsiɗkiɗ ŋ mbeha yasna-kanakɗoh wi a ƴut ŋ panguk ciŋ ɗe jen.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Camba 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:11">Pula 20:11</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5"/>Waaye, ŋ Fiis cii, a woyis ne : « Ɓa rahsanɗi muk iɗsiɗki ŋ gap ɓa. » <verse eid="HEB 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6"/>Ɓi koc kerah yegɗoh muc, ɓa rahasɗi iɗsiɗki sagu kerhiɗaaɗi Kooh. Waaye wa wooriɗ ne raakiɗ poyi, ɓi joya min rahas. <verse eid="HEB 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7"/>Ineem weɗ tah, wa degga kiis laayiɗ, a gapissa mbeh wiiriis, a teekkaa "woti". A taambohha ŋ woosuuɗi Dawuuda a woosaa, ngaŋ Fiis ci ɓoo raaw jang an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">« Woti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">ɗu kerah hoosooriŋ Kooh ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">kinaat ndeng haf.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Sabuur 95:7-8</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8"/>Kur ka Yosuwe aasɗohee caac caŋ ɓoo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kur ka Yosuwe aasɗohee caac caŋ ɓoo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa nikee Kanaan, wa Kooh kocee gap Ibrahiima. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-7">Camba 12:1-7</ref></char>) E <char style="w">Musaa</char> pulɗee Israayel ci, ɓi rimkoh ŋ Ibrahiima, <char style="w">Misra</char> (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 12:29-42">Pula 12:29-42</ref></char>) ; Yosuwe, yi adgoh Israayel ci ŋ finho Musaa, aasiɗta ɓa ŋ kur ka. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JOS 4">Yosuwe 4</ref></char>) Ɓa mirndohhaa teek Israayel.</char></note> nikeen ɗiski ɓa joy iɗsiɗkoh ɗah, Kooh heeɗi woyisse ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ mbeh wiiriis. <verse eid="HEB 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9"/>Kon po woti, Kooh ɗaakɗiɗ ɓooɓiŋ ɗe jamano iɗsiɗkoha findi mbehi yasna-kanakɗohi. <verse eid="HEB 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10"/>Laam ɓo' nu rahas iɗsiɗki a gapoh ɗah, fu namiɗ iɗsiɗuk ŋ panguk ciŋ ɗa findi Kooh iɗsiɗkoh ŋ ciŋ ɗe.<verse eid="HEB 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11"/>Kon mbaa ɓoo ndengɗukaat, ɓoo rahas iɗsiɗkeem ne ali ɓo' nikuu kerhiɗaaɗi po a kee keena findi caac caŋ ɓoo. <verse eid="HEB 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12"/>Laam woo kiŋ Kooh wii pes te wa raakiɗ hatil, weɗ uup kaañ ndang nu na nguɗe na ɓak kanak ɗah. Weɗ na kaɗe po wa saɓsoh coonndiŋ ɓoyi na liiɓiŋ ɗe, pok pok ciŋ ɗe na soriŋ ɗe te wa inhisohee ini ɓo' waaɗ ŋ ɗooƴ keeñ na ini a na liiɓe. <verse eid="HEB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13"/>Raakɗi feruuɗi ɗemb Kooh, in ci jen rangsukiɗ halang ŋ fiki Kooh, Yi ɓoo woyan in ci ɓoo tum.<verse eid="HEB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Seeƴkiɗohi yakki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14"/>Ŋ woyeen ne ɓoo raak Seeƴkiɗoh yakak. A Seeƴkiɗoh yakoh na yakoh yi taamb ŋ Eel ci po reesa ŋ ɗiskaŋ Kooh, a Yeesu <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char>. Kon ɓoo nengaat baahiɗ ŋ waasi ɓoo na woye ne weɗ ɓoo kos. <verse eid="HEB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15"/>Seeƴkiɗohi yakki ɓoo raak miniɗ ɓaah na ɓoo yeg-yeg ŋ mitaaɗiikiŋ ɓoo. Kinaat liiɓ ne a minɗaa ! A miniɗa, laam a jaɗɗuuɗ fiir ŋ in ci jen findi ɓoo. Waaye, ŋ fiiri a fiirsee weem, a moosɗi bakaaɗoh.<verse eid="HEB 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16"/>Kon, ɓoo kinaat supuk, ɓoo reɓaat ŋ ɓoofohaaniŋ Kooh yi na ɗaasohe, ne ɓoo min ɗe misik, a baahoh ɓoo, ŋ ineem, a min ɓoo hirip ŋ jamanooniŋ wa.<verse eid="HEB 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1"/>Seeƴkiɗoh yakak nu tanu ŋ ɓooɓi ɗah, a tufkiɗu ne a nikiɗ ɓa ŋ fiki Kooh ; a wikee onoh ci, a seeƴkee sagu bakaaɗ ci. <verse eid="HEB 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2"/>A yi ŋ haf ce a mitɗi, weɗ tah a miniɗ nik na inhaaɗiici na muuƴiɗ ci, a muñɗee ɓa. <verse eid="HEB 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3"/>A mitaaɗiikiŋ ɗe tah po a joyya seeƴuk sagu bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗe haf ce, findi a na seeƴkohe sagu ciŋ ɓooɓi.<verse eid="HEB 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4"/>Ali ɓo' minɗi eɗ haf ce cir seeƴkiɗoh yakak. A Kooh na ɓeeɗke ɓo' nga, findi a ɓeeɗkoh <char style="w">Aaruna</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aaruna </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: a nikee yakak <char style="w">Musaa</char>, seeƴkiɗoh ciŋ <char style="w">waasiŋ Musaa</char> puloh nga ɗe.</char></note> nga. <verse eid="HEB 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5"/>Mucɗohi Gapohse sah eɗkootɗi cir Seeƴkiɗoh yakak. A rahsoha ŋ Kooh yi woo ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:5">« Woti, ñam Baab ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:5">a fu <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ ngo</char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sabuur 2:7</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6"/>A woyissa ŋ ɗisik wiiriis ŋ Fiis ci ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">« Fu tufkiɗuuɗ Seeƴkiɗoh po faw,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">Seeƴkiɗoh findi Melkisedek<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 14:18-20">Camba 14:18-20</ref></char> teeɓohiɗ ne Melkisedek nikee buur, a nammba nik seeƴkiɗoh wuu Kooh. <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110">Sabuur 110</ref></char> yegɗohiɗ buur wiiriis, yi na haye ŋ fikiiri, yi nikan seeƴkiɗoh findi Melkisedek, te Dawuuda teek ɗe ndeem "heɗ ce".</char></note>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:18-20">Camba 14:18-20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 110:4">Sabuur 110:4</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7"/>Mucɗohi Gapohse, ngaŋ kipes kiŋ ɗe ŋ kehƴi, a kiimiɗ Kooh yi minee ɗe muciɗ ŋ kakaan. A kiimiɗ keeh-keeh ŋ ɗafka-ɗafka na muhun. Kiimiŋ ɗe teyɗukuusa sagu nupi a nup Kooh. <verse eid="HEB 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8"/>Ini a nikee Kuɓu jen, a jangiɗ kerhiɗ Kooh ŋ miskiɗ ci a raak. <verse eid="HEB 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9"/>Wa Kooh reyiɗ ɗe ɗiski a joyee ree ngaŋ mit, a nikka yi na eɗe ɓooɓi kerhiɗ ɗe jen muci reehanɗi. <verse eid="HEB 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10"/>Ee, a Kooh tufkiɗ ɗe Seeƴkiɗoh yakak findi Melkisedek.<verse eid="HEB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kañam ndengiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11"/>Ini kaɗ ŋ ineem, ɓoo waaɗiɗ woo in laayiɗ nga, waaye kerhohaaɗiŋ ɗu yiih yiih kotii, tahha po wa yooɓɗi ne ɗu teeɓu ini ca tokis. <verse eid="HEB 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12"/>Ina ɗu kosoh poyi, wii joyee ɗu raak jangɗohe, waaye ɗu ris etohiɗ jangɗu in ci na kockohse ŋ in ci Kooh woo. Ɗu etohisiɗ ɓap, ɗu hatilɗi kañam ndengiɗ. <verse eid="HEB 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13"/>Te yaa nu na ɓape ɗah, a gooy ; a meeɗɗi woo ci yurhiɗ ci paaɗ, a minɗi ca inhisoh. <verse eid="HEB 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14"/>Waaye kañam ndengiɗ, wa wuu yakak ci fu inah ne ɓa meeɗɗiɗ haf ɓa inhisoh baahiɗ na baahaaɗi po ƴutiɗ.<verse eid="HEB 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6"/>
  <para style="s">Ini nik ŋ faɗ kos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1"/>Mbaa ɓoo cootkaat in ci ɓoo koc jang ŋ <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> te ɓoo tufuk ŋ jangɗohi mitiɗi. Ɓoo kinaat dokuk finho, ɓoo tufkiɗissee jangɗoh ci na ɗeɓgohse, findi : raak inwaaso ŋ tumohaaɗ ci na ɓayohe ŋ kakaan, na kos Kooh, <verse eid="HEB 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2"/>ini kaɗ ŋ ɓoktuk ci, degohiŋ yaah ci, hultiŋ kaaniɗ ci, na atteeni na hee kaɗe po faw. <verse eid="HEB 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3"/>Wa neɓ Kooh ɗah, ɓoo na hee yurhiɗkohe ŋ jangɗohi mitiɗi kotii.<verse eid="HEB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4-6"/>Laam, ɓoo rahsiɗ leeriŋ Kooh te ɓoo ƴoohha ini a onoh, ɓoo ɓaahha rahas <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, ɓoo ƴoohha baah kiŋ woo kiŋ Kooh na hatili nik ŋ adinaani na haye. Ɓi moos rahas in ceem te ɓa faɗta ca, ɓa minisɗi ɓayu po inwaaso ambis ɓa ŋ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa. Ɓak ɓa nga, ɓa na daaƴisse <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char> ŋ kurwaana te ɓa na wiñee ɗe ne a heefu.<verse eid="HEB 6:4-6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7"/>Wa mand na keheƴ ; wa an masmiŋ toɓi na keenee nga te wa eɗoh in raakiɗ njiriñ ŋ ɓooɓi na guurɗukee wa ɗah, Kooh heya barke'ɗe. <verse eid="HEB 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8"/>Waaye wa eɗoh paangi raakiɗ rup na ñaaɓaaɓ ɗah, wa raakɗi njiriñ ; weɗi ŋ kot alku te wa mirndohan raaɓu.<verse eid="HEB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9"/>Ɗu ɓi ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, ɓoo min woyoh ɗaa, waaye wa wooriɗ ɓoo ne ɗiski ɗu nik, weɗ uup baah, te wa hun na muci. <verse eid="HEB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10"/>Kooh yurhaaɗiiɗi po a kee alkoha pangkiŋ ɗu na waaɗohi ɗu teeɓoh ŋ tiikiŋ ɗe. Ɗu teeɓohiɗa ŋ taambkohi ɗu taambkohee ɓooɓiŋ ɗe te ɗu ris ɓa wa tumiɗ. <verse eid="HEB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11"/>Ini neɓan ɓoo, weɗ ne yaa nu nga ɗu ɗah, ndengɗukoh ɗaa po ŋ reehɗohaana, po mbaɗna in ci ɗu ooluk raakan. <verse eid="HEB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12"/>Ŋ ineem ɗu nikuu ɓo' faɗsukiɗ, te ɗu taamb ŋ kot ciŋ ɓooɓi kos te ɓa ambsohhaa na muñ po ɓa rahassa in ci Kooh gapee ɓa.<verse eid="HEB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Giñ na gap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13"/>Wa Kooh na gape Ibrahiima, a giñ giñ. Raakɗi ini uup Kooh, weɗ tah po wa a giñee, a ginnja ŋ haf ce ; <verse eid="HEB 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14"/>an : « Ŋ giñiɗ ne ŋ hey ɗa barke'ɗe, ŋ laayiɗ ɓi rimkohan nga ɗa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-17">Camba 22:16-17</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="HEB 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15"/>Ŋ ineem, Ibrahiima sekeeɗa na muñ, po a rahassa ini Kooh gapee ɗe. <verse eid="HEB 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16"/>Ɓo' giñeesa ɗah, a na giñe ŋ tiikiŋ yi uup ɗe, wa ndengiɗ woo kiŋ ɗe, jaar taastiɗoh ci jen reeh.<verse eid="HEB 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17"/>Kooh waaɗee teeɓ wooriɗ ɓooɓi laman in ci a gapoh ne, a dokkanɗi finho nga, weɗ tah a ndengiɗtaa na giñ. <verse eid="HEB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18"/>Giñ na gap tahiɗ po wa wooriɗ ɓoo ne Kooh dokkanɗi finho. In ci kanak ceem minɗi ɓoƴsu. Ini a woo nga ca, wa minɗi nik in wiiriis dal keeh. Ineem na ñaahe ɓoo baahiɗ, ɓoo ɓi fu inah ne, ɓoo naafkiɗ nga ɗe. Wa na ñaahe ɓoo ne ɓoo min amb ndengiɗ ini ɓoo taaknu te ɓoo oolukka ne ɓoo hey wa rahse.<verse eid="HEB 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19"/>Oolkeem, weɗ amb ruuh findi sap seroha gaal, wa wooriɗ te wa ndengiɗ. Wa taamb ŋ ridoona, wa korra ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ɗiski Hooliɗi na Ɗiski Hoolohngaani">Ɗiska Hoolohngaana</char> ŋ Eel ca. <verse eid="HEB 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20"/>Weɗ ɗiska a koc ɓoo aas, te a aas nga wuu ɓoo, a yi Yeesu. A aas nga, tufkiɗuuɗ Seeƴkiɗoh yakak po faw findi Melkisedek.<verse eid="HEB 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na Melkisedek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1"/>Melkisedek yeem, a nikee buuraŋ Salem, a nammba nik seeƴkiɗohiŋ Kooh, yi ŋ ɗafka ɗafka. Wa Ibrahiima laɓ buur ca po a gurdeeɗa, a yi Melkisedek, a yi kee coha na ɗe, a yi barke'iɗ Ibrahiima ŋ cohaam. <verse eid="HEB 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2"/>Ɓaatta nga, Ibrahiima ɓayya ŋ in ca a naafee ŋ buur ca, a eɗta ɗe ndaŋkiyaah nu nik winooriŋ wa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:17-20">Camba 14:17-20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 7:2">Tiikiŋ Melkisedek, wa tokis buuri na tiindɗe waas. Te a nikee buuriŋ Salem, wa tokis buur jam. <verse eid="HEB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3"/>Melkisedek nak ɓoo inhiɗɗi ɗe baab, ɓoo inhiɗɗi ɗe yaay wala caac. Te wa raakɗi ɗiski rimuukiŋ ɗe wala kakaan kiŋ ɗe fiisu. A mand na Yeesu <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char>, a seeƴkiɗoh po faw.<verse eid="HEB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4"/>Markaat findi a yakoh, caaciŋ ɓoo Ibrahiima sah eɗiɗ ɗe ŋ in ca a kooɗohee ŋ hiñohaŋ ɗe na buur ca, ndaŋkiyaah nu nik winooriŋ wa. <verse eid="HEB 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5"/>Te <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char>, wa nak ɓi ɓaah ŋ cuuɓiŋ Lewi, ɓi nikee <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ci, ne ɓeɗ rahsan ŋ ɓaah ciŋ ɓa Israayel ci, ngaŋ ini ɓa na raake, ndaŋkiyaah nu nik winooriŋ wa. Moona ɓa jen ɓa rimkoh ŋ Ibrahiima. <verse eid="HEB 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6"/>Waaye Melkisedek nak, ali a rimkohɗi nga ɓa, a rahsiɗ ineem ngaŋ Ibrahiima. Melkisedek barke'iɗta ɗe, te kat, Ibrahiima a yi nikee ɓoyi Kooh gape. <verse eid="HEB 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7"/>Wa raakɗi laam-laam, yi uup yak, a yi na barke'ɗe yi uup ƴin.<verse eid="HEB 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8"/>Seeƴkiɗoh ci rimkoh ŋ Lewi, ɓi na waɗse ndaŋkiyaah<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21-32">Kind ci 18:21-32</ref></char></note> nu nik winooriŋ wa ngaŋ in ci ɓooɓi raak, mbeh na haye ɓa kaan, waaye Melkisedek nak, rahsiɗ waɗeem findiiɓa, te Fiis ci seede'iɗ ne a pesoh. <verse eid="HEB 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9"/>E ɓi ɓaah ngaŋ Lewi ɓeɗ na eɗse waɗeem, moona deey ɓo' miniɗ woo ne Lewi sah eɗiɗ Melkisedek waɗeem taamboh ŋ Ibrahiima. <verse eid="HEB 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10"/>A yi Lewi, raak ɗe rimuuɗi ndoom, a nikee ŋ ñif miŋ caac ɓa Ibrahiima, wa Melkisedek kaɗ coha na Ibrahiima.<verse eid="HEB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11"/>Nikee ne pangkiŋ seeƴkiɗoh ciŋ cuuɓiŋ Lewi, wi waasiŋ Israayel ci gaƴkoh, mineen tum po ɓo' mit ɗah, mbaa wa heeɗi etohisse Seeƴkiɗoh wiiriis "findi Melkisedek", yi ɓaahɗi ŋ ɓi rimkoh ŋ <char style="w">Aaruna</char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1-29:46">Pula 28:1–29:46</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12"/>Kooh ɓoƴsoh findi seeƴkiɗoh ci na kooɗohse ɗah, e waasi ɓoƴsohu.<verse eid="HEB 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13"/>Laam, ɓoyi Fiis ci na woye ndii, a puloh ŋ cuuɓ wiiriis wi ɓaahɗi na wiŋ Lewi, te cuuɓeem, ali ɓo' moosɗi panguk nga findi seeƴkiɗoh. <verse eid="HEB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14"/>Ɓooɓi jen inhiɗ ne Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu rimuk ŋ cuuɓiŋ Yudaa. Te Musaa, wi a na woye ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ seeƴkiɗoh ci, a wooɗi ali in ŋ cuuɓeem.<verse eid="HEB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15"/>Wa ɓaatiɗ leer wi Seeƴkiɗoh wiiriis tufkiɗu, te findi Melkisedek, <verse eid="HEB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16"/>a tumuuɗi seeƴkiɗoh ŋ nakohi kaɗ ŋ yi rimkoh ŋ cuuɓii wala ŋ cuuɓii, waaye a tumuuɗa ŋ doolndiŋ kipes ki minɗi reehɗu. <verse eid="HEB 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17"/>Laam Fiis ci woyiɗ inii nga ɗe :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:17">« Fu tufkiɗuuɗ Seeƴkiɗoh po faw,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:17">Seeƴkiɗoh findi Melkisedek. »<verse eid="HEB 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18"/>Ŋ ɓak, nakoha maañɗa nihsuuɗ sagu raakaaɗiikiŋ wa hatil na njiriñ, <verse eid="HEB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19"/>laam waasiŋ Musaa moosɗi mitiɗ ali in ; ŋ ɓak wiiriis, Kooh oniɗ ɓoo ini uupa, wi ɓoo min ooluk ne ɓoo taamboh nga, ɓoo reɓ ɗe. <verse eid="HEB 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20"/>Ɓaatta nga, ineem nikɗi in ƴin ; wa hunee na giñ ! Seeƴkiɗoh ci ɓinooɓi tufkiɗasseesa ɗah, wa na huneeɗi na giñ, <verse eid="HEB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21"/>waaye wi ɓoyi Fiis cii na woye tufkiɗasse, Kooh giñ giñ ɗiski Fiis ci woo ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">« Heɗi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Heɗi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Sabuur 110:4</ref></char> woo "Nikiɗi". Yawuut caŋ jamanoonaŋ Yeesu meeɗeen sang woo tiikeem ŋ ɗafka, sagu hooli wa hool.</char></note> giñiɗ te a dokkanɗi finho nga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">fu tufkiɗuuɗ Seeƴkiɗoh po faw.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Sabuur 110:4</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22"/>E giñi tah po yi deguk ambtiɗohi uup baah, e Yeesu. <verse eid="HEB 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23"/>Te wa raakissiɗ in wiiriis : Weɗ ne seeƴkiɗoh ci ɓinooɓi laayiɗ sagu kakaan ki ; gomal nu gomal, yaa nu kaannda ɗah, morom ce namsiɗ ɗe, ineem weɗ hondoh ɓa nik seeƴkiɗoh po faw. <verse eid="HEB 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24"/>Waaye Yeesu, kipes kiŋ ɗe heyɗi reehe, weɗ tah a Seeƴkiɗohi moosanɗi namsiɗu. <verse eid="HEB 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25"/>Ineem weɗ tah a namiɗ min muciɗ muc mitiɗ ɓi taamboh nga ɗe ne ɓa reɓ ngaŋ Kooh. Laam, a pesan pes po faw ne a ngelɗee ɓa.<verse eid="HEB 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu a yi Seeƴkiɗohiŋ Ambtiɗohi Asi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26"/>Seeƴkiɗoh yakak mand ɗaa, a yi ɓoo etohee keeh-keeh, a hooliɗ, a raakɗi bakaaɗ, a raakɗi usuɓ, a saɓsohuuɗ na bakaaɗoh ci te Kooh meeɓiɗ ɗe po ŋ ɗafuk Eel ca. <verse eid="HEB 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27"/>A mandɗi na seeƴkiɗoh ci yakak ci ɓinooɓi ne mbeh nu nik, ɓa joyiɗ seeƴuk sagu bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa haf ɓa, po ƴut, ɓa seeƴkis sagu caŋ ɓooɓa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:1-24">Lewiici 9:1-24</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 16:1-34">16:1-34</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:1-29:39">Kind ci 28:1–29:39</ref></char></note> Yeesu seeƴkiɗ waas yino po faw wi a eɗoh haf ce ne a hooliɗ bakaaɗ ci. <verse eid="HEB 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28"/>Seeƴkiɗoh ci yakak ci waasiŋ Musaa tufkiɗee, ɓa nikee seeƴkiɗoh mitaaɗi, waaye Seeƴkiɗohi yakki Kooh tufkiɗ na giñ, wi waasi eɗohu po ƴutta, e Kuɓkiŋ ɗe, te Kuɓkeem, a mitɗiɗ ɗe po faw.<verse eid="HEB 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1"/>Inii weɗ uup raak njiriñ ngaŋ ini ɓoo na woye jen : Weɗ ne ɓoo raakiɗ Seeƴkiɗoh yakak mand ɗaa. A yaa ɓooffa ŋ Eel ca, ŋ ñaahmaŋ ɓoofohaanaŋ Kooh yi buur. <verse eid="HEB 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2"/>A yaa panguk ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ɗiski Hooliɗi na Ɗiski Hoolohngaani">Ɗiska Hooliɗa</char>, weɗ <char style="w" lemma="ɗiip">ɗiipa</char> keeh-keeha, Kahnaŋ Kooh, wa fu inah ne a Heɗi tufkiɗa, ɓo' haɓiɗɗaa.<verse eid="HEB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3"/>
    <char style="w" lemma="seeƴkiɗoh">Seeƴkiɗoh</char> yakak nu fu hot ɗah, a tufkiɗu ne a eɗee Kooh onoh ci, na seeƴuk ci. Kon Seeƴkiɗohiŋ ɓoo joyeen nam raak ini a eɗohan. <verse eid="HEB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4"/>A nikee ŋ kehƴi ɗah, a heeɗi sah nike seeƴkiɗoh, laam raakiɗ seeƴkiɗoh ci nik ndii, ɓi na eɗee Kooh onoh ci findi <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> nakohoha. <verse eid="HEB 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5"/>Ɓeɗ ɓeem, ɓa na pangkiɗe Kooh ŋ ɗisik wi fu inah ne wa ñaamaariŋ in ca keeh-keeh ca nik ŋ ɗafka. Wa saangniŋ ca rek. Findi Fiis ci woyoha, wa Musaa hee haɓɗe ɗiipa nikee <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, Kooh woytoh ɗe woytoh an : « Marka, te fu haɓiɗa jen, findi wa fu teeɓsee ŋ ɗafuk tangoori.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Pula 25:40</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6"/>Ɗiski wa nik, Yeesu a yi eɗu ne a nik ŋ harmban ɓooɓi na Kooh ne a tiindiɗ ambtiɗoh as, wi deguk ŋ gapoh as. Findi <char style="w" lemma="Ambtiɗohi Koc na wi Asi">Ambtiɗohi Asi</char> uupoh wa koc, te findi gapoh ci as ci namoh uup ca koc, pangkiŋ ɗe uupoh fuuf wiŋ seeƴkiɗoh ci koc ɗaa.<verse eid="HEB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woyaahiŋ Ambtiɗoha Koc</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7"/>Ŋ Ambtiɗoha Koc, woyaah raakeeɗi nga ɗah, kon wa heeɗi etohisse ne Ambtiɗohi Kanakɗoh tufkiɗasse. <verse eid="HEB 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8"/>Waaye Kooh raak raak woyaah nga, findi wa woyohu ŋ Fiis ci ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">« A Heɗi woo ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">“ Inhaat ne : Mbeh cii hayeeɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">ŋ hey tufkiɗe ambtiɗoh as na cuuɓiŋ Israayel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">na wiŋ Yudaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Israayel na Yudaa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Yudaa, a kuɓu Yaŋhooɓa yi Kooh teek Israayel, kon cuuɓiŋ Yudaa ɓaah ngaŋ cuuɓiŋ Israayel. Waaye, wa buur Suleymaan kaan, kur kaŋ Israayel saɓsukohha kanak. Ɓaka nikee ŋ yaah-sing ne fu yurhiɗkoh pulohaaɗ-noh ɗah, rissa na tiikiŋ Israayel, ɓaki tas teekuusa Yudaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 12:1-24">1 Buur ci 12:1-24</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 10:1-11:4">2 Nguur ci 10:1–11:4</ref></char>).</char></note>.<verse eid="HEB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9"/>Wa mandanɗi na ambtiɗohi ŋ tufkiɗee na caac caŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">wa ŋ amb ɓa ŋ yaah</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">ne ŋ puliɗ ɓa <char style="w">Misra</char>.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">Laam ɓa ambɗi Ambtiɗohi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">weɗ tah ŋ liiɓisɗi nga ɓa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">Mi yi Heɗi, ñam woo wa.<verse eid="HEB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10"/>Ambtiɗohii weɗ maa hee tufkiɗe na cuuɓiŋ Israayel</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">ŋ finho mbeh ceem :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">- Mi yi Heɗi, ñam woo wa -</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">Ŋ hey ɓeke nakoh ciŋ ngo ŋ liiɓ ciŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">ŋ fiis ca ŋ ɗooƴ keeñ ciŋ ɓa ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">ŋ nik Koohiŋ ɓa, ɓa nik ɓooɓiŋ ngo.<verse eid="HEB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11"/>Ali ɓo' jangɗissanɗi gentohiŋ ɗe wala ɓaah ce,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">a woyee ɗe ne : ‘Inha Heɗi.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">Ɓooɓi jen hey yo inhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">ini amboh ŋ yi uup ƴissuut po ŋ yi uup yak.<verse eid="HEB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12"/>Laam ŋ hey ɓa ɗaase kiyurhaaɗiikiŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:12">ŋ naandsukissanɗi bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa. ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Yeremi 31:31-34</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13"/>Kon Kooh woyee woo ambtiɗoh as ɗah, raakee ɗe kiisiɗ kiisiɗ wa koc. In nu maañ po wa yakakee ɗah, wa usisɗi ŋ coot.<verse eid="HEB 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9"/>
  <para style="s">Seeƴuk ciŋ Ambtiɗohi Koc</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1"/>Ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ambtiɗohi Koc na wi Asi">Ambtiɗoha Koc</char>, ɓi nakoh tufkiɗasseen ne ca teeɓ ɓooɓi findi ɓa joy ñaamkoh Kooh. Wa nammba raak ɗisik hooliɗ ŋ kehƴi, ñaamkohaa ɗe. <verse eid="HEB 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2"/>Wa nikka <char style="w" lemma="ɗiip">ɗiipa</char> nikee <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char> ; ɓakaŋ wa koc teeksee <char style="w" lemma="Ɗiski Hooliɗi na Ɗiski Hoolohngaani">Ɗiska Hooliɗa</char>, degohaanaŋ laampaaca nikee nga na taaɓla na degohse mbuuruuci wuu Kooh. <verse eid="HEB 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3"/>E rido saɓsohee wa na ɓaka kanakɗoh ; ɓakeem teeksee <char style="w" lemma="Ɗiski Hooliɗi na Ɗiski Hoolohngaani">Ɗiska Hoolohngaana</char>. <verse eid="HEB 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4"/>Ndaam raakeen <char style="w">seeƴkoha</char> hoomɗoha cuuraay ; seeƴkohaanaam haɓɗohsee urus.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 9:4">Wahndeenaŋ Ambtiɗohi namee nik nga, wa muurohuusa urus ŋ ɓak ci jen. Meeme haɓɗohu urus ɓekseen ŋ wahndeena, weɗ tumohsee <char style="tl">maana</char>, kañam ka Israayel ci eɗsee ŋ kehƴa hulanga.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4-34">Pula 16:4-34</ref></char></note> Ndooɗaŋ Aaruna namee nik ŋ wahndeena, weɗ ndooɗa pulɗee kifis na pos.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 17:25">Kind ci 17:25</ref></char></note> Atoh ca ɗapas ca fu inah ne woo ciŋ Ambtiɗohi fiissee nga ca, namee ɗaaku nga. <verse eid="HEB 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5"/>Nataal caŋ feruuɗ ca nik ŋ Asamaan, ci na woyse <char style="w"><char style="tl">seruben</char></char> deguusa ŋ ɗafuk wa ne ca teeɓoh ne yaki Kooh yak waa ŋ ndaam ; paɓ ciŋ ca saangneeɗa kunohaana, weɗ ɗiska na ɗaasohse bakaaɗ. Waaye pooksohiŋ ƴohiŋ woo ceem, wa tahɗi ɓoo kuruk.<verse eid="HEB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6"/>Mbaa, in ceem jen tufkiɗohsee ɗaa. Kooh-nu-wiis ɗah, seeƴkiɗoh ca aas ŋ ɓaki koc ne ɓa haɓiɗ pangkiŋ ɓa. <verse eid="HEB 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7"/>Waaye a <char style="w" lemma="seeƴkiɗoh">seeƴkiɗohi</char> yakki dong meeɗ aas ŋ ɓaki kanakɗoh te wa na nikee waas yino ŋ kiis ki. A aasuu nga muk ɓayndohaaɗi ñif ; ñif meem, a wiŋ ɗoopti a seeƴkoh wuu bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗe haf ce na ci ɓooɓi tum te ɓa tiiɗi ca.<verse eid="HEB 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8"/>
    <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> na teeɓohe ndii ne, feeh ɓaki koc wa ɗii nga ɗah, waasi kaɗ ŋ Ɗiska Hoolohngaana rangsuuɗi paaɗ. <verse eid="HEB 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9"/>Wa ñaamaar ngaŋ jamanooni woti ; wa tokis ne onoh ci na seeƴuk ci wuu Kooh minɗi tah hafiŋ ɓoyi na tumee ca yeeɓuk jameet ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="HEB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10"/>Ca nakoh ci top ŋ faan dong, findi kañam ci na anaah ci na farsuk ci ɗalohiɗ ci. Ca nikee nga po findi Kooh eɗoh tiindohaaɗi asi.<verse eid="HEB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mucɗohi Gapohse seeƴkoh kiñin kiŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11"/>
    <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> hayiɗ findi Seeƴkiɗoh yakak ne a rangis waasiŋ in ci baahiɗ ci hay. A aas ŋ ɗiipi uup yak, uuppa mit, Kahnaŋ Kooh wa yaah ɓo' haɓiɗɗi, weɗ ne wa ɓaahɗi ŋ ferii. <verse eid="HEB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12"/>A aasiɗ nga po ŋ ɗooƴ Ɗiska Hoolohngaana ; wa nikka waasi yinooreem. A eɗohɗi ñif suket nga wala ñif ɗoon, a eɗoh ñif miŋ ɗe, a rahassa muciŋ ɓoo po faw.<verse eid="HEB 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13"/>Ɓo' hoolaaɗi, a lisu ñif suket wala ñif naar-coc, wala weti kooɗohu ŋ inoh yu' dohuuɗ ɗah, wa ɓokit faaniŋ ɗe. <verse eid="HEB 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14"/>Nik ne wa raakoh ɗaa ɗah, ñif miŋ Mucɗohi Kooh gapohee weɗ joy uupiɗ hatil. Mucɗohi taamboh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, yi gen gen, a eɗta haf ce Kooh. A nikka seeƴkaah raakaaɗi sikka, a hey ɓoo ɓokte ŋ tumohaaɗ ci na ɓayohe ŋ kakaan po haf ciŋ ɓoo yeeɓuk ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓoo, ne ɓoo min ñaamuk Koohi na pese.<verse eid="HEB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15"/>Ɗaa, ngaŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ambtiɗohi Koc na wi Asi">Ambtiɗohi Asi</char> Kooh tufkiɗ na ɓooɓi, a Mucɗohi Gapohse a yi nik ŋ harmban ce na ɓa, ne ɓooɓi Kooh ɓeeɗuk min rahas lamaahi minɗi reeh, wi a gapee ɓa. Ini tah po ɓa heya mine rahas weɗ ne, kaani etohsee kaanuuɗ, kaani joyee tos ɓooɓi ŋ bakaaɗ ci tumsee ŋ Ambtiɗoha Koc.<verse eid="HEB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16"/>Ɓoyi kaan, te raak ɗe dengkohiɗ findi raak-raak kiŋ ɗe joy paysohohu ɗah, wa joyiɗ hoolɗu ne kakaan kiŋ ɓoyeem raakiɗ. <verse eid="HEB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17"/>Laam, e kakaan na tufkiɗe dengkoh ; feeh ɓoyeem yii pes ɗah, dengkohiŋ ɗe tufukɗi. <verse eid="HEB 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18"/>Ambtiɗoha Koc mand ɗaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ŋ gerek, tiik ci kanak cii, "ambtiɗoh", na "dengkohiŋ ɓoyi kaan", ca yino. Fiisohi kelsuk kelsuk na ca ndii.</char></note>, feeh ñif aamkeeɗi ɗah wa heeɗi cambe tiindɗu.<verse eid="HEB 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19"/>Wa <char style="w">Musaa</char> woo ɓooɓa jen nakoh nu nik ŋ waasi po ƴutta, a ɓayya ñif maŋ ɗoon ca [na waŋ suket ca] a ambsohha ca na masuɓ, a ɓayya car <char style="tl">hisoɓ</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hisoɓ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa kidig ƴin. Car ci ceɗ ɓooɓa meeɗ lisoh ne ɓa farsee ɗah. </char></note>, a tokiɗtaa ooy ruumind haɓɗohuuɗ find mbaal. A ɓekeeɗaa ŋ ñif ma, a liseeɗaa, po ŋ teerndiŋ waasi sah ; a nammbaa lis ŋ ɓooɓa jen. <verse eid="HEB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20"/>A woyeeɗa ne : « Wii, weɗ ñif mi aamu wuu ambtiɗohi Kooh tufkiɗ na ɗu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Pula 24:8</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="HEB 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21"/>A nammba lis ñif ma ŋ ɗiipa nikee Kahnaŋ Kooh na in ca ɓa na njirñiɗkohe jen ne ɓa nikiɗeesa Kooh ɗah. <verse eid="HEB 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22"/>Findi waasi woyoha, ini uup ngaŋ in ci jen na farsohse ñif, ñif aamukɗi ɗah, ɗaasoh bakaaɗ raakanɗi.<verse eid="HEB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mucɗohi Gapohse eɗohiɗ haf ce waas yino po faw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23"/>Nik ne ñaamaariŋ in caŋ ɗafka weɗ joy farsohu ɗaa ɗah, kon seeƴki joy hooliɗ in ca kiyooh ca ŋ ɗafka joy uup. <verse eid="HEB 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24"/>Kiristaa aasɗi ŋ Ɗiski Hoolohngaani yaah ɓo' haɓiɗ, weɗ wi fu inah ne wa ñaamaariŋ Ɗiska Hoolohngaana keeh-keeha ; a aas ŋ ɗooƴ Eel ci sah te ɗiski wa nik, a yaa tufkiɗta ɓoo ŋ fiki Kooh.<verse eid="HEB 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25"/>Ŋ <char style="w">waasiŋ Musaa</char>, kiis nu ree ɗah, seeƴkiɗohi yakki aas ŋ Ɗiska Hoolohngaana na ñif mi nikɗi wiŋ ɗe ; waaye Kiristaa, a aasɗi ŋ ɗooƴ Eel ci ne a eɗohe kipes kiŋ ɗe a eɗohissee wa. <verse eid="HEB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26"/>Wa nikohee ɗaa ɗah, mbaa a heen joye yaaɓ waas laayiɗ ŋ ina Adina camboh po wi. Waaye a hayiɗ waas yino ngaŋ jamanooci mirndoh, ne a moos bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓooɓi ŋ seeƴki a seeƴkoh haf ce.<verse eid="HEB 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27"/>Findi ɓo' na kaanohe waas yino, ƴut ɗah, a taamb ŋ atteena, <verse eid="HEB 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28"/>Mucɗohi Gapohse namiɗ eɗoh haf ce ɗaa waas yino po faw, ne a deguk bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓi ɓo' laayiɗ. Ƴut ɗah a hayis waasiŋ ɗe kanakɗoh, te bakaaɗ ci tahuu, waaye a hayissan ne a teeɓuk ɓi seesuk ɗe hot ne ɓa rahas muci.<verse eid="HEB 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10"/>
  <para style="s">Seeƴki neɓ Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1"/>
    <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">Waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char>, wa in ci baahiɗ ci keeh-keeh ci joy hay haa, wa ñaamaariŋ ca rek. Kiis nu kiis, <char style="w">seeƴkohaaɗ</char> ciŋ wa yino ; wa dokke, wa dokkisse. Ɓi na taambɗee wa ne ɓa reɓ Kooh, wa moosanɗi ɓa min tah mit. <verse eid="HEB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2"/>Wa mineen tah ɓo' mit ɗah, ɓi na ñaamkohe Kooh ɗaa hee ñaamke waas yino, ɓa hool po faw. Ɓa heeɗi yegisse ɓitkiŋ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa po ɓa seeƴke, ɓa seeƴkisse.<verse eid="HEB 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3"/>Seeƴuk ceem na naandse ɓa bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa kiis nu ree. <verse eid="HEB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4"/>Ñif miŋ naar ci na wiŋ suket ci moosanɗi min nihis bakaaɗ ci. <verse eid="HEB 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5"/>Weɗ tah, ngaŋ Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci, wi Mucɗohi Kooh gapohe haye Adina, a woo Kooh ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">« Ini fu waaɗee keeh-keeh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">a seeƴuk ci na onoh ci haa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">waaye fu mahiɗ to faan.<verse eid="HEB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6"/>Fu raakɗi ini neɓ ɗa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:6">ŋ ɗoopaat ci na <char style="w" lemma="hoomiɗ">hoomɗasse</char> ŋ seeƴkohaani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:6">na seeƴuk ci wuu bakaaɗ ;<verse eid="HEB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7"/>teemb ndeem ŋ woosa ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">Kooh ! Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woyiɗ ŋ ini kaɗ nga so<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 40:7-9">Sabuur 40:7-9</ref></char></note> ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">ŋ hayiɗ ne ŋ tum ini fu waaɗ. »<verse eid="HEB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8"/>A camboh woo kiŋ ɗe ne seeƴuk ci na onoh ci, ɗoopaat ci na hoomɗasse ŋ seeƴkohaani, na seeƴuk ci wuu bakaaɗ ci, Kooh waaɗeeɗi ca keeh-keeh, te a raakɗi ini neɓ ɗe nga ca. Te moona waasi nakoh ne seeƴuk ceem jen joy joy tumu.<verse eid="HEB 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9"/>A degga nga ne a hayiɗ ne a tum ini Kooh waaɗ. A nihis ini koc, a tufkiɗta wi kanakɗoh. <verse eid="HEB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10"/>Kon, waaɗ-waaɗiŋ Kooh tah po Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> eɗohiɗ faaniŋ ɗe waas yino po faw, ɓoo hoolla, ɓoo nikka <char style="w" lemma="ɓo'-Kooh ci">ɓo'-Kooh</char>.<verse eid="HEB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11"/>Ŋ waasiŋ Musaa, seeƴkiɗoh nu nik na tufke ŋ pangkiŋ ɗe Kooh-nu-wiis. A seeƴkee seeƴuk ci a na seeƴkange te ca moosanɗi min nihis bakaaɗ ci. <verse eid="HEB 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12"/>Waaye Mucɗohi Kooh gapohe nak, a seeƴuk wuu bakaaɗ ci seeƴuk yino, a ɓooffa ŋ ñaahmaŋ Kooh po faw. <verse eid="HEB 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13"/>Ɗiski wa nik, a na seke ne sangiɗ ciŋ ɗe folu, ɓa tumu degoha kot wuu ce. <verse eid="HEB 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14"/>Laam ŋ seeƴuk yino, a tumiɗ po ɓa nikiɗ ɓo' mitiɗ po faw, ɓi na hoolɗasse ŋ bakaaɗ.<verse eid="HEB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15"/>Ineem weɗ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> ndengɗiɗ ɓoo, ŋ ɗiski Fiis ci woo ne :<verse eid="HEB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16"/>« Ambtiɗohii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">weɗ maa hee tufkiɗe na ɓa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">ŋ finho mbeh ceem :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">- Mi yi Heɗi, ñam woo wa -</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">Ŋ hey ɓeke nakoh ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">ŋ fiis ca ŋ liiɓ ciŋ ɓa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:33">Yeremi 31:33</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17"/>Fiis ci woyissa nga ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:17">« Ŋ naandsukissanɗi muk bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:17">na tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɓa moɗaaɗiici.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:34">Yeremi 31:34</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18"/>In ceem ɗaasohu ɗah, seeƴuk wuu ca etohissuuɗi.<verse eid="HEB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓoo ambaat keeh ki, ɓoo pesoha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ɓoo ambaat ne ɓoo miniɗ taamboh ŋ ñif miŋ seeƴkiŋ Yeesu, ɓoo aas supkaaɗi ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ɗiski Hooliɗi na Ɗiski Hoolohngaani">Ɗiska Hoolohngaana</char>. <verse eid="HEB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20"/>Ɓoo ambaat ne a rangsiɗiɗ ɓoo waas as, taamboh ŋ ridoonaŋ wa, weɗ ne faaniŋ ɗe. Waaseem, wii pes. <verse eid="HEB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21"/>Te ɓoo ambaat ne ɓoo raak Seeƴkiɗoh yakak yi adgoh Kahan Kooh, wa nikka ɓooɓiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="HEB 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22"/>Mbaa ɓoo reɓgaat Kooh na keeñ keeh-keeh na ooluk mitiɗ wi puloh ŋ kos, laam keeñ ciŋ ɓoo lisuuɗ ñif miŋ Yeesu ne ca ɓoktu ngaŋ ɓitkiŋ moɗaaɗiici, te faan ciŋ ɓoo ɓookuuɗ na masuɓ hooliɗ.<verse eid="HEB 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23"/>Te ɓoo ambaat ndengiɗ ini ɓoo woo ne weɗ ɓoo yaakaar te ɓoo faɗsukuu. Laam, Kooh na dokkeeɗi finho ŋ in ci a gapoh.<verse eid="HEB 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24"/>Yaa nu nga ɓoo faɗohaat morom ce nof ne ɓoo hiirtiɗohee ŋ waaɗoh na tum in baahiɗ. <verse eid="HEB 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25"/>Ɓoo kinaat faɗ coh ci ɓoo na cohe. Ɓinooɓi faɗiɗ ca po wa nikiɗ ini ɓa meeɗ. Ineem kinaat ɓoo rahas. Ɓoo joy joy ñaahtiɗoh. Te ɗu uupee hot ne mbehiŋ Heɗ ɓoo wii reɓeeɗa ɗah, uupaat nga ñaahtiɗoh.<verse eid="HEB 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26"/>Laam, ɓoo rahas keeh ki po ɓoo inaha wooriɗ te ɓoo ris bakaaɗee ŋ ini ɓoo ti' ɗah, inhaat ne, seeƴki min hooliɗ bakaaɗ ci raakisɗi. <verse eid="HEB 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27"/>Ini na hee tase kay, weɗ ne ɓoo saakɗohee, sekee ini na haye, atteeni na yongkaahi miskiɗi na hee hoomɗe ɓi sang Kooh.<verse eid="HEB 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28"/>Ɓo' sannga taambiɗ nakoh ciŋ waasiŋ Musaa, te ɓo' kanak wala kaahay seede ne a nikɗi ŋ waas ɗah, a na apse yirmassaaɗi. <verse eid="HEB 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29"/>Kon ɓo' nu heef <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char> po a faaleeɗi ɗe ɗah, findi a joy mbugalohu mandan na misik ? Ɓoyeem eɗɗi ñif miŋ Ambtiɗohi ciri inaa Kooh joy eɗu, ñif mi fu inah ne, weɗ hooliɗ ɗe, a nikka ɓo'-Kooh. Ɓaatta nga, a ɓasiɗ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani na inhiɗohe baahohiŋ Kooh.<verse eid="HEB 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30"/>Te ɓoo inhiɗ baahiɗ Yi woo ŋ Fiis ci ne : « Ñam raak wirndiɗkoh, ñam na hee wirnduke tumohaaɗ ci moɗaaɗiici !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:25">Rohƴiɗi 32:25</ref></char></note> » Fiis ci woyissa ne : « Heɗi hey atte'e ɓooɓiŋ ɗe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:36">Rohƴiɗi 32:36</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="HEB 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31"/>Kooh yii pes, de' ! Mas ɓoyi keenan ŋ yaah ciŋ ɗe !<verse eid="HEB 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32"/>Naandsukaat ina raake, wa ɗu rahas leeri ; ŋ jamanoonaam ɗu leberiɗ keeh-keeh na miskiɗ ca. <verse eid="HEB 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33"/>Cum ɗah, ɗu ɓasse, ɗu mbugalse ŋ fiki ɓooɓi jen. Cum ɗah, ɗu ɓaah miskiɗi na ɓi tumsee ineem. <verse eid="HEB 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34"/>Miskiɗi ɓi ambsee ŋ kaso raakee, ɗu ɓaahhaa na ɓa. Ɗu teyɗukeen na keeñ soosiɗ ne raak-raakaŋ ɗu naafu, sagu inha ɗu inhee ne, ɗu raakiɗ wi ngisoh te wa genan gen.<verse eid="HEB 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35"/>Mbaa ɗah, kinaat mbet oolki ɗu ooluk, wa hun na aaf yakak. <verse eid="HEB 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36"/>Ɗu etohiɗ muñ ɗu seke. Ɗu tumohee wa ɗaa ɗah, ɗu na tume ini Kooh waaɗ, ɗu mirndohan rahas ini a gapoh. <verse eid="HEB 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37"/>Laam, Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woo ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">« Tas ƴissuut, ƴissuut rek,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">ɓoyi na haye, hay ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">a nikanɗi hayaaɗi ŋ wahtuuniŋ wa.<verse eid="HEB 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38"/>Ɓoyiŋ ngo yurhiɗi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">pesohan kosi a kos.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">Waaye a dokuk finho nga ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">keeñiŋ ngo soosanɗi nga ɗe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:3">Habakuk 2:3</ref>,<ref loc="HAB 2:4">4</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39"/>Ɓoo nak, ɓoo ɓaahɗi ŋ ɓooɓi na dokke finho ; dokuk finho na ɓekohee ŋ ɗumbu. Ɓoo kosiɗ Kooh te ɓoo hey muce.<verse eid="HEB 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11"/>
  <para style="s">Caac caŋ ɓoo na kosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1"/>Kos weɗ ne : wa woor ɓoyi ne in ci yaakaaru raakiɗ, te a ooluk ne in ci hotuuɗi nikiɗ. <verse eid="HEB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2"/>Caac ciŋ ɓoo kosohee ɗaa, weɗi tah Kooh seede'iɗ ɓa seede moɗiɗ ŋ Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci.<verse eid="HEB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3"/>A kos tah po, ɓoo hotta ne Adina ferohu woo kiŋ Kooh, kon in ci na hotke pulohɗi ŋ ini ɓo' min hot.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:1-2:25">Camba 1:1–2:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4"/>A kos tah po, Abel <char style="w">seeƴukka</char> wuu Kooh seeƴki uup baah wiŋ Kayin. A weɗ tah po Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci seede'iɗ ne a ɓo' yurhiɗ, Kooh seede'iɗ ɗe ŋ teyɗuka a teyɗuk seeƴkaŋ ɗe. A kos tah po, ŋ ini a nik ɓo' kaaniɗ jen, a ris woo poyi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3">Camba 4:3</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 4:10">10</ref> </char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5"/>A kos tah po, Henok coottohuusa ne a lahuu ŋ kakaan. A hotissuuɗi, laam a Kooh coottoh ɗe. Waaye bala a coottohsan ɗah, Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci seede'iɗ ne a neɓiɗ Kooh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:18-24">Camba 5:18-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6"/>Ɗal kos ɗah, ali ɓo' minɗi neɓ Kooh. Laam ɓo' nu waaɗ reɓ Kooh ɗah, fu joyiɗ kos ne a nikiɗ te a na aafe aaf ɓi na waakee ɗe.<verse eid="HEB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7"/>A kos tah po, wa Noohin inhiɗu in ci hee raake te ɓo' hotɗi ca paaɗ, a kerhiɗta Kooh, a haɓiɗta gaal yakak ne a muciɗ ɓi kahan ce. A kosa a kosee tah po a ɓurra ɓi Adina, a rahassa kiyurhi kos na eɗohe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:8-8:17">Camba 6:8–8:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8"/>A kos tah po, wa Ibrahiima ɓeeɗku, a teyɗukka kaɗ kur ka a joyee rahas lamaah lamu te a inahɗi ɗiska a kaɗe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-7">Camba 12:1-7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9"/>A kosa a kosee tah po, a gennda ŋ kur ka a gapse findi hanhe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:4">Camba 23:4</ref></char></note> ; a gennda ngaŋ <char style="w">ɗiip</char> na Isaahha na Yaŋhooɓa ɓi Kooh namee gap ne ɓa hey name lam kur keem.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:2-6">Camba 26:2-6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:13-15">28:13-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10"/>A sekeeɗa ne a gen ŋ kur-taaha yipu ŋ atoh, wi fu inah ne a Kooh fiisoota, taɓahhaa.<verse eid="HEB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11"/>A kos tah, Kooh tummba po Ibrahiima na Saarata minnda raak kuɓu, ali nik ne ɓa yakeen ŋ raak kuɓu, te a yi Saarata sah, a nikee ɓitiɓ minaaɗi raak kuɓu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:1-7">Camba 21:1-7</ref></char></note> Wa wooree woor Ibrahiima ne Yi gapoh na dokkeeɗi finho.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:1-6">Camba 15:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12"/>Tahha po wa raakangannga, ɓi laayiɗ rimkohha ngaŋ ɓo' yino yi useeɗi kakaan ; ɓa laayya po haa hor ciŋ eel ci, ɓa minaaɗiisa kindu po haa merhey miŋ yaah-cookmi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:17">Camba 22:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13"/>Ɓooɓi kosee ɓeem jen kaan na kos. Ɓa rahasɗi in ci Kooh gapohe, waaye ɓa ƴokiɗ ca, ɓa summba nga ca po haa ɓoyi na taambɗukee ɓo' ; ɓa woosa halang ne ɓa hanhe ngaŋ kehƴi,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:9">Camba 47:9</ref></char></note> ɓa ɓaaɓoh. <verse eid="HEB 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14"/>Ɓi na woyohee ɗaa na teeɓohe wooriɗ ne ɓa na waake kur ki ɓa min ɓaahoh. <verse eid="HEB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15"/>Nikee ne, a kur ka ɓa pulohee weɗ hel ciŋ ɓa nikohee ɗah, ɓa heen mine dokuk nga. <verse eid="HEB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16"/>Waaye ɓa waaɗee wi uup baah, wi nik ŋ Eel ci. Weɗ tah Kooh supukɗi ɓeeɗkohu Koohiŋ ɓa, laam a kooɗkiɗiɗ ɓa kur.<verse eid="HEB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17"/>A kos tah po, wa Ibrahiima markiskasse, a teyɗukka ne a seeƴkoh kuɓkiŋ ɗe Isaahha, kuɓkiŋ ɗe yino-kongi. Waam raak ɗe gapuuɗ, <verse eid="HEB 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18"/>te ŋ in ci a gapse, Kooh woyiɗ ɗe nga ne : « Fu raakohan ɓi rimkohan nga ɗa ŋ Isaahha.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Camba 21:12</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="HEB 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19"/>Ibrahiima markeen po a inahha ne Kooh raakiɗ hatili min hultiɗ kaaniɗ sah. Ŋ ineem, ɓo' miniɗ woo ne a wiku wiku kuɓkiŋ ɗe findi ɓoyi hultiɗu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Camba 22:1-14</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20"/>A kos tah po, Isaahha nammba barke'iɗ Yaŋhooɓa na Esaaw ŋ in ca haye.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:1-40">Camba 27:1-40</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21"/>A kos tah po, wa Yaŋhooɓa na kaane, a barke'iɗta yaa nu nga ŋ kuɓuuciŋ Yuusufa,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 48">Camba 48</ref></char></note> a ambaalukka ŋ hafiŋ ndooɗiŋ ɗe, a ƴekka ne a ñaamuk Kooh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:31">Camba 47:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22"/>A kos tah po, wa Yuusufa hee kaane, a woosa ŋ pulaŋ Israayel <char style="w">Misra</char>, a dengkohha ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ ƴoh ciŋ ɗe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:24-26">Camba 50:24-26</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23"/>A kos tah po, wa <char style="w">Musaa</char> rimu, yaay ɓa na baab ɓa ɗasiɗta ɗe caɓin kaahay. Laam ɓa hoteen moɗ ŋ kuɓka te ɓa neƴƴoheeɗi nakohaŋ buura.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:1-2">Pula 2:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24"/>A kos tah po, wa Musaa yak, a teyɗukɗi kerhis ne a kuɓu ngaŋ kuɓki ɓitɓiŋ <char style="w" lemma="Firawna">Firawnaana</char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:3-15">Pula 2:3-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25"/>A tannda ne a mbugalu na cuuɓiŋ Kooh, te raak kipes kiŋ ɗe mineen neɓ ; waaye neɓɗeem heen reehe te wa hee nike neɓiɗ ŋ bakaaɗ. <verse eid="HEB 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26"/>Teyɗuk heefu findi <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char>, weɗ ngisohɗee ɗe raak-raakiŋ Misra jen ; laam a degee has ciŋ ɗe ŋ aafi Kooh aafan ɗe.<verse eid="HEB 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27"/>A kos tah po, a pulohha Misra te a neƴƴohɗi ayrukaŋ buura.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3-14">Pula 3–14</ref></char></note> Wa mand haa ne a hotee Yi na hotseeɗi, weɗ tah ɗe muñeeɗa.<verse eid="HEB 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28"/>A kos tah po, Musaa haɓiɗta seeƴkaŋ <char style="tl"><char style="w">Paak</char></char>, a woosa ɓooɓa ne ɓa reefaat ñif ma ŋ yahndeer ca ne malaakaani na yahrohe hay ɗah, a laaluu saaw ciŋ Israayel ca.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12">Pula 12</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29"/>A kos tah po, wa Israayel ca taamb ŋ ɗooƴ Cookma-Ruumnda, wa mannda haa ɓa taamb ŋ merhey suyiɗ ; ɓi Misra jeemmba nam taamb nga, masma onnda ɓa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14">Pula 14</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30"/>A kos tah po, wa Israayel ca taambɗee miira ɗingee Yeriko, ɓa wileeɗaa, po ɓa raakka neeh yasna-kanak na ineem, miira keennda juƴ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6">Yosuwe 6</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31"/>A kos tah po, wa ɓooɓa taambɗeeɗi Kooh apse, Rahab, ɓitɓa toonkoha, mucca, laam a taambkohee taambkoh moɗoɗ espiyoŋ ca Israayel ca tuuƴe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2">Yosuwe 2</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 6">6</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32"/>Ŋ joy ye ɓaatis kotii ? Wa haɓɗi nga ne ŋ woo ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Gedewon,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6-8">Kilifaaci 6–8</ref></char></note> Barak,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 4-5">Kilifaaci 4–5</ref></char></note> Samson,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 13-16">Kilifaaci 13–16</ref></char></note> Yefte,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 10:6-12:7">Kilifaaci 10:6–12:7</ref></char></note> Dawuuda,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16-31">1 Samuwel 16–31</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 1">2 Samuwel</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 1:1-2:10">1 Buur ci 1:1–2:10</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 11-29">1 Nguur ci 11–29</ref></char></note> Samuwel<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 1-28">1 Samuwel 1–28</ref></char></note> na woosuuɗ ci. <verse eid="HEB 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33"/>E kos tah po, ɓa folla ɓi buur po ɓa degga kur ciŋ ɓa yaah, ɓa tiindɗeeɗa waas, ɓa rahassa in ci Kooh gapohe, ɓa rannga nguɓ gaynde saahiɗ,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6">Dañeel 6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34"/>ɓa ƴimmba doole yongkaah,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3">Dañeel 3</ref></char></note> ɓa mucca ngaŋ kaañ ndang, ɓa rahassa hatili ɓa raakeeɗi, ɓa nikka jalmba ŋ hiñoh, ɓa ngekka hiñohoh caŋ kur ca cinooca.<verse eid="HEB 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35"/>Wa haɓɗi nga ne ŋ nam woo ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ ɓitiɓ ca wiksee kaaniɗ ciŋ ɓa hultiɗuuɗ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:7-24">1 Buur ci 17:7-24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:8-37">2 Buur ci 4:8-37</ref></char></note> Na ɓi ɓo' wiiriis, ɓi kaan ŋ mbugal ca ɓa mbugalse, sagu waaɗa ɓa waaɗeeɗi findi ɓa hee pulɗohse nga ; ɓa waaɗee rahas hulti na eɗohe kipes ki ngisoh kipes ki ɓa hee ñake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Marka teerndi woysang 2 Makabee, saar 2. Teerndeem, wa ɓaah ngaŋ fiis ci na woyse "<char style="tl">apokrif</char>". Fu waak ca ngaŋ <char style="tl">biibal</char> ci ŋ peɗeem ci cinooci ɗah, cum raakiɗ ca, cum raakɗi ca.</char></note>. <verse eid="HEB 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36"/>Na ɓi wiiriis, ɓi njembtasse, laɓseeɗa ngeer, jatngasseeɗa, ɓekseeɗa ŋ kasooci, te ɓa munnja. <verse eid="HEB 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37"/>Ɓum tapseeɗa atoh po ɓa kaannda, ɓinooɓi ɓesuusa ŋ leerni, [ɓinooɓi nattu'seeɗa,] ɓum apuusa na ndang, raakka ɓi raakeeɗi ali in, ɓa ɓekkee und mbaal wala und pe', ɓa wileeɗa ɓak nu ɓak, ɓa torhiɗasseeɗa, ɓa mbugalseeɗa. <verse eid="HEB 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38"/>Adina yeyyoo'eeɗi ɓa ! Ɓa nikee nga, ɓa kaɗeeɗa ɗisik nu ɗisik ŋ bilaf ci na tangooci, na ɗembohaaci nik ŋ hur ciŋ atoh ci na nung ciŋ kehƴi.<verse eid="HEB 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39"/>Ɓooɓeem jen, a kosiŋ ɓa tah po, ɓa seede'ɗuusa seede moɗiɗ. Moona deey, ɓa rahseeɗi ini Kooh gapohe. <verse eid="HEB 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40"/>Laam, Kooh kooɗkiɗee ɓoo in wiiriis wi uup baah, a waaɗeeɗi ne ɓa mitɗu te ɓoo ɓaahuu nga.<verse eid="HEB 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12"/>
  <para style="s">Muñ ngaŋ koɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1"/>Ŋ ineem, ɓoo hotiɗ ne, ɓa seede laayoh na laayoh ɓeɗ wil ɓoo, kon ɓoo kocukohaat na nup kocukohi ɓoo degu te ɓoo muñ po ɓoo ree. Tahha po ɓoo kaambsukaat raanoo raan, weɗ ne ɓoo saɓsukoh na bakaaɗ nu nik, laam bakaaɗ na longɗohe yooɓoh na yooɓoh. <verse eid="HEB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2"/>Ɓoo nupee ɗah, ɓoo markaat ŋ Yeesu yi tufkiɗ kosi te a mitiɗtaa. A hotee neɓɗi a degɗassee ne a heya rahse, weɗ tah ɗe muñ ŋ kurwaana te a marakɗi ŋ kaciika. A ɓoofiɗ kotii ŋ ñaahmaŋ ɓoofohaanaŋ Kooh. <verse eid="HEB 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3"/>Markaat ŋ yi muñee sangi bakaaɗoh ci sangee hun na ɗe, ne ɗu yaaɓuu po ɗu kee goya. <verse eid="HEB 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4"/>Leberiŋ ɗu na bakaaɗ, ñif miŋ ɗu aamukɗi nga paaɗ. <verse eid="HEB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5"/>Ɗu alkoh alkoh deng ci ɗu dengse po haa kuɓu e ? Findi Fiis ci woyoh ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">« Kuɓu, kina heef koɗiŋ Heɗi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">te a woytohee ɗa ɗah, kina faɗsuk.<verse eid="HEB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6"/>Laam, Heɗi na koɗe ɓoyi a waaɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:6">te ɓi a teyɗuk findi kuɓu jen, ɓeɗ a na laɓe leraw.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:11-12">Gonaah ci 3:11-12</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7"/>Muñaat miskiɗ ci Kooh na degee ɗu, a na degee ɗu ca ne a koɗ ɗu. Laam a amb ɗu findi kuɓuuciŋ ɗe. A yinde kuɓu a yi baabiŋ ɗe na koɗeeɗi ? <verse eid="HEB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8"/>Koɗi ɓooɓi jen na koɗse, nik ne wa ɗaliɗ ɗu ɗah, ɗu kuɓu keeh-keeh haa, ɗu kuɓu lewaaɗi. <verse eid="HEB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9"/>Ɓoo jen baab ci rim ɓoo na koɗe ɓoo koɗ te ɓoo kerhiɗiɗ ɓa ; ŋ woyisɗi ɗa Kooh, Baabiŋ ɓoo ; ɓoo kerhiɗaat ɗe, ɓoo min pes. <verse eid="HEB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10"/>Baab ciŋ ɓoo na koɗe ɓoo ɓi kiis rek, ŋ findi ɓa hotoh ; Kooh nak, koɗi a na koɗe ɓoo, wa ini baah nga ɓoo ne a ɓaahndoh ɓoo ŋ hool kiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="HEB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11"/>Wa keeh ne ɓo' koɗsee ɗah, wa na nikeeɗi in neɓiɗ nga ɗe, wa in miskiɗ ; waaye wa na mirndohe rimiɗ ɓi teyɗuk taamb nga kipes yurhiɗ huniɗ na jam.<verse eid="HEB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12"/>Weɗ tah, poɗsaat yaah ciŋ ɗu neeɓohiɗ ci</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:12">na ƴii ciŋ ɗu sangiɗ ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:3">Esayi 35:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13"/>Haɓɗiɗaat kot ciŋ ɗu waas yurhiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:13">ne wi na yiiɓe nga ca ɗiindkohuu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:13">waaye wa kooɗoh wir nga.<verse eid="HEB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14"/>Waakaat jam na ɓooɓi jen, ɗu waak hool kiŋ <char style="w" lemma="ɓo'-Kooh ci">ɓo'-Kooh</char>. Ɗal hool keem ɗah, ali ɓo' hotanɗi Heɗ ɓoo. <verse eid="HEB 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15"/>Wortukaat po ali ɓo' tasuu finho ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ baahohi Kooh na baahohe. Wortukaat po ali ɓo' nga ɗu kinaat mand na niir baahaaɗi, wi kifis na in moɗaaɗi po wa kee kaɓa ɓo' laayiɗ ŋ aay kiŋ wa. <verse eid="HEB 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16"/>Wortukaat po ali ɓo' kinaat nik njaalo'oh wala a heef in ciŋ Kooh, findi Esaaw yi lofkohee waɗi a joyee rahas findi saaw sagu noɗ yino dong. <verse eid="HEB 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17"/>Ɗu inhiɗ ne ŋ mirndaani, wa a waaɗ lam barkeeniŋ baab ɓa, a teyɗukɗuuɗi. Inwaaso ammba ɗe nga po a fuɗeeɗa, waaye ŋ ɓarang ɓarang.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:36-40">Camba 27:36-40</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tangooci kanak ci : Sinaay na Siyong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18"/>Ɗu nak, ɗu reɓ ŋ tangoori min laalu haa. Tangooriŋ Sinaay<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sinaay </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa tango, Nikiɗi teeɓkohee Israayel ci nga.</char></note> caac caŋ ɗu reɓee, wi riifee na yongkaah na puuɗis, wa ñuussa tuɗ, <verse eid="HEB 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19"/>wa ɗiiɗɗeeɗa sagu kuluɓ roofiɗ, na hooso feyohiɗ po ɓa kerhee nga kiimeeɗa ne, ɓa waaɗisɗi kerah hoosooreem. <verse eid="HEB 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20"/>Ɓa kaañeeɗi kaañeeɗi nakohii : « Ali ɗoopaat sah laal tangoori, a hey tapsohse atoh po a kaan.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:12-13">Pula 19:12-13</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 19:16-22">16-22</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="HEB 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21"/>Ina ɓa hotee tiitɗoheen po <char style="w">Musaa</char> woosa ne : « Ŋ tiitiɗ po mi yii saakɗoheeɗa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:19">Rohƴiɗi 9:19</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22"/>Waaye ɗu, ɗu reɓ tangooriŋ Siyong<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Siyong </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa tango, Yerusalem wa ɗii ŋ ɗafuk wa.</char></note>, kur kiŋ Koohi na pese. Weɗ Yerusalemaŋ Eel ca, mbuumbaaya ɓi junni junni malaaka cohoh. <verse eid="HEB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23"/>Ɗiski ɗu reɓ, ɗu reɓ ŋ cohiŋ saaw ci, ɓeɗ ɓi tiik ciŋ ɓa fiisu ŋ Eel ci. Ɗu reɓ ŋ Kooh yi na atte'e ɓooɓi jen. Ɗu reɓ ŋ ruuh ciŋ ɓooɓi yurhiɗ ci te ɓa mitɗuusa. <verse eid="HEB 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24"/>Ɗu reɓ ŋ Yeesu yi nik ŋ harmban ɓoo na Kooh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ambtiɗohi Koc na wi Asi">Ambtiɗohi Asi</char> ; ɗu reɓ ŋ ñif miŋ ɗe lisu te ini ñif meem woo, wa uuppa baah ini ñif miŋ Abel woye.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:10">Camba 4:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25"/>Wortukaat ! Kinaat ɗikɗuk Yi na woye na ɗu. Ɓi sangee sikɗuk yi woyee na ɓa ŋ kehƴi, ɓa fuseeɗi ŋ mbugal. Ɓoo nak, Kooh na woyohe na ɓoo ŋ Eel ci, kon ɓoo suungɗuk ɗe ɗah, wa wooriɗ ne ɓoo hey mbugalse. <verse eid="HEB 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26"/>Waam hoosooriŋ ɗe yoondɗee kehƴi, waaye wii a gapkiɗ ŋ Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci an : « Tasiɗ waas yino, mi, ŋ hey yoondɗisse kehƴi, wa nikan weɗ dong haa, waaye na Eel ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hage 2:6</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="HEB 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27"/>Ŋ woo ki a woo an "tasiɗ waas yino", ineem weɗ teeɓoh ne in ci min yoondɗu, ci hotkang, hey coote, ci minɗi yoondɗu ris.<verse eid="HEB 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28"/>Ini kaɗ nga ɓoo, ɓoo rahas Nguuri minɗi yoondɗu, ɓoo genaat corkiɗ Kooh, weɗ na tahe ɓoo min ɗe ñaamuk ñaamki neɓ ɗe, wa hun na eɗ ɗe cir na nup ɗe. <verse eid="HEB 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29"/>Laam Koohiŋ ɓoo nam nik yongkaahi na hoomɗe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Rohƴiɗi 4:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13"/>
  <para style="s">Pesohaaɗ moɗiɗ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1"/>Waaɗtiɗohiŋ ɗu genaat gen. Ɗu jen, e ɗu ɓaah. <verse eid="HEB 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2"/>Kinaat alkoh taambkoh ɓi na haye nga ɗu. Raakiɗ ɓi meeɗa tum po ɓa daliɗta ɓi malaaka te ɓa inheeɗi ne ɓa daliɗ malaaka.<verse eid="HEB 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3"/>Naandsukaat ɓi taƴu, po wa mand haa ne ɗu ɓii na ɓa ŋ kaso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 13:3">Naandsukaat ɓi nik ŋ mbugal, po wa mand haa ne e faan ciŋ ɗu na mbugalse.<verse eid="HEB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4"/>Ɓooɓi jen ambaat sey, ɓa eɗa cir te ƴaar top ŋ ɓitiice, ɓitiɓ top ŋ ƴaar ce ; laam Kooh hey atte'e mbalayoh ci na njaalo'oh ci.<verse eid="HEB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5"/>Ŋ pesohaaɗiŋ ɗu, kinaat waaɗ kopor lool ; ini ɗu raak doyaat ɗu. Kooh sah woyiɗ ŋ Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci ne : « Ŋ alkohanɗi ɗa te ŋ faɗanɗi ɗa muk.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:5">Yosuwe 1:5</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="HEB 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6"/>Weɗ tah ɓoo miniɗ woo wooriɗ woo kii :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">« Heɗi a yi ɓaatɗohohiŋ ngo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">ŋ heyɗi neƴƴohe ali in.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">Ɓo' min ndo ye tum ?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Sabuur 118:6</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="HEB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7"/>Naandsukaat ɓi adgohee ɗu, ɓi inhiɗ ɗu woo kiŋ Kooh. Markaat findi ɓa pesohe, na findi kipes kiŋ ɓa reehoh, ɗu altiɗkoh ɓa ŋ kosa ɓa kose.<verse eid="HEB 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8"/>Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> ɓoƴsukohɗi ; findi a mandee wotɓa, a mand ɗaa woti te a mandan ɗaa po faw. <verse eid="HEB 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9"/>Kinaat ñaañohu ɗu jangɗasse ɓi jang mbalay ɗalohiɗ na ini ɗu inhiɗasse. Wa moɗiɗ ne baahohiŋ Kooh ɓaat keeñ ciŋ ɗu hatil, waaye, ca joyɗi ɓaatohu hatil na nakoh ci kaɗ kañam. Laam nakoh ceem moosɗi njirñoh ɓooɓa taambɗee ca ali in.<verse eid="HEB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10"/>Ɓoo raakiɗ ɗisik seeƴkoha wi fu inah ne, <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ciŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char> ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ambtiɗohi Koc na wi Asi">Ambtiɗohi Koc</char> joyɗi kooɗoh kañam kiŋ ɓa nga. <verse eid="HEB 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11"/>Findi seeƴkiɗohi yakki meeɗ tum, ne a seeƴkeesa wuu bakaaɗ ci ɗah ; a meeɗ aam ñif miŋ ɗoopaat ci ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ɗiski Hooliɗi na Ɗiski Hoolohngaani">Ɗiska Hoolohngaana</char>, waaye ca na ñamseeɗi, ca meeɗ meeɗ dohu ŋ bilaf fa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:27">Lewiici 16:27</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12"/>Weɗ tah po miskiɗaŋ Yeesu nammba raakoh ŋ finho kur ka, ne a hooliɗ ɓooɓi na ñif miŋ ɗe, ɓa nik <char style="w" lemma="ɓo'-Kooh ci">ɓo'-Kooh</char>. <verse eid="HEB 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13"/>Mbaa ɓoo pulaat, ɓoo kaɗ coha na ɗe ŋ bilaf fa, ne ɓoo teyɗuk ɓasu na ɗe. <verse eid="HEB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14"/>Laam ɓoo raakootɗi ndii kur ki risan po faw, waaye ɓoo na waake wi na haye.<verse eid="HEB 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15"/>Kon ɓoo taambohaat ŋ Yeesu, ɓoo gen ŋ yakiɗ Kooh, wa nik seeƴki wuu Kooh. Weɗ ne ɓoo ƴeekee ƴeek ci na teeɓohe ne ɓoo hun na ɗe.<verse eid="HEB 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16"/>Kinaat aloh tum in baahiɗ na ɓaah ini fu raak na ɓooɓi, in ceem ca findi seeƴuk ci neɓ Kooh.<verse eid="HEB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17"/>Kerhiɗaat ɓi adgoh ɗu te ɗu teyɗuk ñaak nga ɓa ; laam ɓeɗ na niiɗe ini nik ŋ ɗooƴ keeñ ciŋ ɗu te Kooh meeksan ɓa findi ɓa tumohe. Mbaa ɗah, ini ngisoh nga ɗu weɗ ne, ɗu kerhiɗ ɓa ne ɓa min tum pangkiŋ ɓa na keeñ soosiɗ po ɓa raakuu aay-keeñ nga. <verse eid="HEB 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18"/>Kiimɗaat ɓoo Kooh, wa wooriɗ ɓoo ne nikohaaɗiŋ ɓoo, wa ɗaa. Ɓoo waaɗ haɓiɗ baahiɗ ŋ in ci jen. <verse eid="HEB 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19"/>Mi yii nak ɗu keeh-keeh ne ɗu kiimiɗ to, po ŋ min hayis nga ɗu findi wa uup gaawoh.<verse eid="HEB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kiimi</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20"/>Kooh yi na onohe jam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:20">a hultiɗiɗ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:20">yi fu inah ne, na ñif miŋ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:20">a tufkiɗiɗ ambtiɗohi genan gen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:20">a nikka niiɗohiŋ ɓoo yakki.<verse eid="HEB 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21"/>Kooh onaat ɗu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:21">po ɗu min tum in nu baah ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:21">ne ɗu haɓiɗ ini a waaɗ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:21">Te a tumee nga ɓoo ini a teyɗuk,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:21">taamboh ŋ Yeesu Kiristaa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:21">yi yakɗaah po faw.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 13:21"/>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:21">Amiin.<verse eid="HEB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s">Askohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22"/>Mi yii kiim ɗu ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ne ɗu amb woo ceem ; ñam ñaah ɗu na ca, ŋ woo ɗu ca ŋ fiis rohƴiɗ.<verse eid="HEB 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23"/>Inhaat ne Timoote yi ɓaah na ɓoo ini ɓoo kos, faɗsuuɗ. A teel hay ɗah, ŋ hey hune na ɗe, ŋ hey ɗu marke. <verse eid="HEB 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24"/>Kañɗiɗaat to ɓi adgoh ɗu jen na ɓo'-Kooh ci jen. Ɓi Itaali ɓii kañiɗ ɗu. <verse eid="HEB 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25"/>Baahohiŋ Kooh nikaat na ɗu jen.<verse eid="HEB 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13"/>
</usx>
